\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30003895 (OWR-16407-007). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
